      NGRIDS 5
      REL_CUTOFF 60
    &END MGRID
    &POISSON
      PERIODIC NONE
      POISSON_SOLVER MULTIPOLE
      &MULTIPOLE
        &PROGRAM_RUN_INFO OFF
        &END PROGRAM_RUN_INFO
      &END MULTIPOLE
    &END POISSON
    &QS
